    send 42 through socket
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    send "x" through 42
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    close websocket 42
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    close websocket socket with code "soon"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    close websocket socket with code 1000 and reason 5
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say colour of socket
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    on data from 42
        say "never"
    .
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    on connection to socket
        say "never"
    .
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    if 42 is open
        say "never"
    .
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
